# EVENTS — brief acknowledgements. Every frame derives from base.pet sit.
# Headphones match music.pet exactly: k outline row 2 + g band row 3 cols 5-8; cups rows 4-6 =
# outer column (g top, d below) + inner G column over the head edge (cols 1-2 / 11-12), k outside.
# Held headphones (headphones_off): same parts as an arch on the lap — g band rows 10-11, cups rows 12-13
# (outer g/d, inner G) resting on the base paws.

# Surprised: 2x2 wide eyes (cols 4-5, 8-9, same as status timer_alert / music_excited), Y "!" top-right (col 14, rows 0-2 + dot row 4).
@frame notify
..k........k..Y.
.kok......kok.Y.
.kwok....kowk.Y.
.kwookkkkoowk...
.kooooyyooook.Y.
.kooeeooeeook...
.kwoeeooeeowk...
.kwwwwkkwwwwk...
..kwwwwwwwwk....
...kkwwwwkk..kk.
...kowwwwok.kwwk
..koowwwwookkowk
..kooowwoooooook
..kooowwooooOOk.
..kwwkOOkwwkOk..
...kk....kk.k...

