# Celebrate hop: happy ^ ^ eyes + p mouth (react.pet happy); 0 / 2 / 1 rows up (the 2-up frame uses the shared jump
# pose of react.pet jump_air / status.pet timer_done: head 1 row up with base ears, legs tucked, feet 2 rows up). Four confetti pixels (Y r t b) in the top-right, never touching
# each other: bunched low on frame 1, burst up on frame 2, falling on frame 3 (each moves <= 2 px).
@frame celebrate_1
